flowchart LR
  Proposal[Model / Agent / Dream / Rule Proposal]
  Syscall[Semantic Syscall Request]
  Validate[Normalize + Validate + Capability Check]
  Approval{Approval Required?}
  Commit[Transactional Commit]
  Journal[Append Journal Event]
  Audit[Audit + Trace Linkage]
  Reject[Deterministic Rejection]

  Proposal --> Syscall --> Validate
  Validate -->|invalid| Reject --> Audit
  Validate -->|valid| Approval
  Approval -->|denied/missing| Reject
  Approval -->|approved or not needed| Commit --> Journal --> Audit

